# ALLOWLIST .gitignore (Option 2 layout, 2026-10-01).
# Everything at the repo root is ignored unless explicitly re-included below.
# A misfiled file (decision letter, referee PDF, private note) therefore stays
# out of git by default; adding a new top-level folder requires a line here.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/.gitmodules
!/README.md
!/TODO.md
!/admin/
!/coding/
!/data/
!/_logs/
!/_snapshots/
!/papers2read/
!/overleaf

# Private, never committed (re-ignored explicitly for clarity)
CLAUDE.local.md

# Within allowed folders
.DS_Store
data/raw-data/*
!data/raw-data/README.md
__pycache__/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
*.aux
*.log
*.bbl
*.blg
*.synctex.gz

# large, regenerable machine output (e.g. EDA/output, per-run CSVs, MCMC draw archives)
coding/**/output/*
!coding/**/output/README.md
*.mat
